{"product_id":"bio-matcha","title":"Gozen Biome Matcha","description":"\u003cp\u003eMicrobiome matcha from the Gozen farm in Kagoshima Japan established in 1635.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOrganic, single origin. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eInfused with probiotics and postbiotics to support your gut microbiome as part of an optimised lifestyle.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExpect clarity, focus, and steady energy — a gut-conscious ritual to start your day.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHow to Take:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTake one sachet of Gozen Bio Matcha with up to 120 ml of warm water (up to 70 degrees celsius). This wellness shot is best taken on an empty stomach to start your day.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eGozen Bio Matcha can also be enjoyed as a tea or mixed with plant based milk either hot or cold.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePlease do not use with animal based milks in order to uphold the integrity of the product.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Gozen Bio Matcha","offers":[{"title":"1 Pack (30-day supply)","offer_id":52594011537700,"sku":"4571575460057","price":249.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true},{"title":"2 Packs (60-day supply)","offer_id":52594011570468,"sku":"4571575460058","price":449.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true},{"title":"3 Packs (90-day supply)","offer_id":52594011603236,"sku":"4571575460059","price":635.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0963\/6282\/3972\/files\/matchasticks3.jpg?v=1773407362","url":"https:\/\/gozenbiomatcha.com\/products\/bio-matcha","provider":"Gozen Bio Matcha","version":"1.0","type":"link"}